# Build output. Both binaries carry OSS credentials compiled in, so a built
# artefact is as sensitive as the key itself -- never commit one.
bin/
dist/*.exe
dist/agent
dist/admin
# Stray local builds: `go build` with no -o drops the binary beside the source.
go/agent
go/admin
go/sealkey

# Filled-in configuration. The checked-in credentials.go files are templates
# with empty strings; if you keep your real values in a copy, keep it here.
*.local.go
*.local.json
agent.config.json
admin.config.json

# Go
*.test
*.out
vendor/

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# SDD scratch
.superpowers/
